WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Before: the Git controls repeat the same dark border.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.500
Open Workspace mode in the Home preview.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.000
After: the same border comes from one named color.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Workspace mode and the Git chips render as before.
